# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Hallmark web — environment
#
# Every variable below is optional. The app boots and every page renders
# without a single one of them; each variable widens what the app can do or
# raises a rate limit. Anything prefixed NEXT_PUBLIC_ ends up in the browser
# bundle — nothing secret may ever be given that prefix.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- 8004scan indexer -------------------------------------------------------
# The public front door needs no key and allows 180 requests/minute. A key
# raises that to 600/minute. Server-side only: the browser never sees it,
# because every index read goes through a route handler under /api.
SCAN_API_KEY=
# Override the indexer base. Defaults to https://8004scan.io/api/v1 with
# https://api.8004scan.io/api/v1 as the automatic cross-over fallback.
SCAN_BASE_URL=

# --- RPC --------------------------------------------------------------------
# Public nodes are the default and work unauthenticated. Set these to a
# dedicated provider before a demo: the public nodes rate-limit hard and the
# agent list issues one multicall per page.
RPC_URL_56=
RPC_URL_97=

# --- Sponsored demo hire ----------------------------------------------------
# A server-funded hire on BNB testnet (chain 97) so someone with no wallet can
# run the real cycle. Leave SPONSOR_PRIVATE_KEY empty and the button renders as
# unavailable with an explanation rather than failing at click time.
#
# NEVER point this at a mainnet key. The action refuses any chain but 97 with an
# equality check, not a default.
#
# The key needs, on testnet only:
#   - tBNB for gas. Five transactions per run at ~300k gas each; 0.05 tBNB
#     covers well over a hundred runs.
#   - $U for the escrow. The action tops itself up from the faucet at
#     0x86e9197CC0F76E4e4aaa7082180945196bBAb5D3 (10 $U per call) when short,
#     so this is a convenience rather than a requirement.
#
# And it must NOT be:
#   - the payee or owner of any agent it is used to hire. The audited hook
#     classifies such a job `SelfDealt` at funding time: the escrow settles and
#     pays out, but no ERC-8004 rating is written. The action detects this
#     before signing and refuses with an explanation rather than producing a
#     settled job that quietly proves nothing.
SPONSOR_PRIVATE_KEY=
# Hard ceiling on a single sponsored job, in whole $U. Default 5.
# Keep this at or above the escrow's minAttestableBudget (0.1 $U): below that
# floor a job settles but earns no attestation.
SPONSOR_MAX_BUDGET_U=5
# Sponsored hires allowed per IP per hour. Default 3. Enforced in-process, so on
# a serverless deployment each instance counts separately — the real ceiling is
# the sponsor wallet's balance, and the UI says so rather than overclaiming.
SPONSOR_RATE_LIMIT_PER_HOUR=3

# --- Proof page -------------------------------------------------------------
# Nothing to configure. The reverted `fund` transaction and the settled job it
# is paired with are recorded in src/lib/deployments.ts as `proofPair` — they
# are receipts, and a receipt does not change, so they are code rather than
# environment. The rating that settlement produced is re-read from the
# Reputation Registry on every request, so if it ever disappears the page says
# so instead of continuing to claim it.

# --- Deployment -------------------------------------------------------------
# Canonical origin, used for absolute URLs in metadata. Vercel sets
# VERCEL_URL automatically; this only matters for a custom domain.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=
